- HomeTransition.ts.meta committed with a fixed uuid (9c2d1367-124c-4b36-ac39-ab1dd8423770); it was the only committed
  assets/**/*.ts without a .meta, so Creator made a new uuid on every build.
- Web startup 404s: the Mac test build is web-mobile, but startup-art/* only existed under build-templates/web-desktop and
  build-templates/wechatgame, so the web-mobile build had no startup-art/ and StartupLoadingLayer's loadRemote of
  pinwheel.png / bar_fill.png / first_screen_composite.jpg returned 404. Adds build-templates/web-mobile/startup-art with
  the same three files (byte-identical to the other templates). Not part of the WeChat package.
- WorldIntegrationBoot: the notice label starts empty instead of 「流程参考占位 · 非新版B」.
